    <string name="perf_thermal_blocked_title">Per-sensor temperatures: blocked by device policy</string>
    <string name="perf_thermal_blocked_body">Android\'s security policy stops apps on this device from reading the kernel\'s thermal sensors directly. The throttling status above comes from the operating system itself and still works; the battery temperature on the Battery page is also unaffected.</string>
    <string name="perf_thermal_absent_title">Per-sensor temperatures: none on this device</string>
    <string name="perf_thermal_absent_body">This device\'s kernel exposes no thermal zones. The throttling status above comes from the operating system itself and still works.</string>
    <string name="perf_thermal_implausible_title">Per-sensor temperatures: no usable readings</string>
    <string name="perf_thermal_implausible_body">This device\'s thermal sensors can be read, but none of them reported a value that is a plausible temperature, so SysMon shows none rather than inventing numbers. The throttling status above comes from the operating system itself and still works.</string>
    <string name="perf_thermal_note">Sensor names come from the kernel and vary by device; SysMon shows them as reported</string>

